      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T00:28:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The other patches submitted to vendor module (private/desktop) https://arsp-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel-desktop/private/desktop-google/+/4684998/1\nfunction is_vrr_compatible checks for the condition via this flag \n\nFor example\nWe have a panel with 2 modes\n                \"2880x1800\": 120 787968 2880 2928 2960 3040 1800 2146 2154 2160 0x48 0xa\n                \"2880x1800\": 60 787968 2880 2928 2960 3040 1800 4306 4314 4320 0x40 0xa\n\nThe function will send this 2 modes to drm_mode_match and ask it to check with respect to DRM_MODE_MATCH_TIMINGS_VRR \n\ndrm_mode_match will check DRM_MODE_MATCH_TIMINGS_VRR is the criteria being asked. So it will call drm_mode_match_timings_vrr to determine if condition is true.\n\nIn above example, vtotal will be different and rest all will be same.\nSo, drm_mode_match_timings_vrr will return true and fastset can be allowed.",
